<title>Libya: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/libya/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-libya-2026-11-23T03:51:45.198Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:51:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Libyan forces keep shelling Haftar positions while Haftar militia members have surrendered at a strategic airbase, and Turkish officials publicly welcomed a motion supporting the troops. A suspected Ukrainian drone struck a Russian vessel at Benghazi naval base, causing an explosion and later the warship sank after the attack. A second Russian ship was targeted by naval drones off the Libyan coast, extending a series of drone attacks on Russian vessels in the area. An armed group blocked the Hamada oil pipeline for over 20 days, costing the National Oil Corporation $31 million in losses. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/africa/20261122-russian-warship-hit-by-suspected-ukrainian-drone-at-libya-s-benghazi-naval-base&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr894gjz0j0yo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261122-russian-ship-attacked-near-benghazi-in-suspected-drone-attack-ukraine&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/67014244-a737-4be5-ac81-97b77a6912ff?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/22/second-ship-targeted-in-series-of-naval-drone-attacks-off-libyan-coast?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/22/blast-russian-ship-suspected-drone-attack-benghazi-libya&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/91b7a3a6-8ac5-4327-ad03-6d951f287346?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj752ddve27ko?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/22/suspected-drone-strike-hits-russian-ship-at-libyas-benghazi-port-raising-regional-security&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/2c959c95-97a5-4957-9eb2-8436c34ba374?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
